<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian treasury raises two mln dinars at auction.</title>
<headline>Tunisian treasury raises two mln dinars at auction.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunisian Treasury on Tuesday raised two million dinars at its weekly auction of treasury bills, and repaid maturing paper totalling 44.7 million dinars.</p>
<p>It sold 52-week paper at a 6.8750 percent coupon for an amount of two million dinars. (one $=1.1 dinar)</p>
<p>--Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
